style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">Can you reach market-data feeds?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Yes, crypto market-data and aggregator feeds are part of the crypto route in addition to editorial outlets.</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Related industries</p>\n      <h2>Other sectors we cover</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g-3\"><a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"technology.html\" data-reveal><h3>Technology</h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">11,400+ tech desks and newsletters in network</p></a><a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"saas.html\" data-reveal><h3>SaaS & B2B Software</h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">3,900+ B2B review sites and analyst blogs in network</p></a><a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"finance.html\" data-reveal><h3>Finance & Banking</h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Terminal and analyst-desk delivery across 41 markets</p></a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"cta-band\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center;display:inline-flex\">Get started</p>\n      <h2 style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Send your next crypto & web3 announcement to the desks that cover it.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede mx-auto\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;max-width:60ch\">Editorial review, sector targeting, monitoring and AI visibility reporting included.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-actions\" style=\"justify-content:center\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-lg\" href=\"submit.html\">Submit a press release</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" hr